MID_EventLocation_DagsionTempleDagsa: 韃古扎神殿
MID_EventLocation_DagsionArena: 鬥技場
MID_EventLocation_UnderDagsionArena: 鬥技場地下
MID_EventLocation_DagsionTempleCarla: 卡拉神殿
MID_EventLocation_DagsionTempleSmyrnos: 史米爾諾斯神殿
MID_EventLocation_DagsionTempleClaire: 柯雷爾神殿
MID_EventLocation_DagsionTempleAurora: 歐若拉神殿
MID_EventLocation_DagsionTempleJuFas: 幽‧法絲神殿
MID_EventLocation_DagsionTempleJura: 茱拉神殿
MID_EventLocation_DagsionTempleSoleil: 索雷爾神殿
MID_EventLocation_DagsionTempleMars: 馬茲神殿
MID_EventLocation_CrystalPalace: 水晶宮
MID_EventLocation_NearDagsion: 韃古席翁近郊
MID_EventLocation_RoundTable: 圓桌大廳
MID_EventLocation_Sea: 海上
MID_EventLocation_TheZaratan: 札拉坦號
MID_EventLocation_Hideout: 藏身處
MID_EventLocation_MountOrgus: 歐加斯山
MID_EventLocation_MountAtla: 亞特拉山
